1
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:50,520
Xiaoquan.

2
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:52,640
Time to eat.

3
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:56,800
Mom, I want to eat with Dad.

4
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:05,760
Xiaoquan.

5
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,360
Dad is dead.

6
00:02:09,600 --> 00:02:10,840
He won't come back anymore.

7
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:13,560
You need to be like Mom,

8
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,640
be strong.

9
00:02:16,200 --> 00:02:19,360
That man who brought the security officers here last time.

10
00:02:19,640 --> 00:02:21,440
It was he who killed my dad.

11
00:02:21,680 --> 00:02:22,720
That's a matter for adults.

12
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,400
You're just a child.

13
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:25,400
Stay out of it.

14
00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,400
Uncle Yan called him Lu Gao.

15
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:29,560
I remembered it.

16
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,720
I will avenge my dad.

17
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:33,600
Xiaoquan.

18
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:36,520
I have already lost Dad.

19
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:38,440
You're still young.

20
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:39,880
Don't think of seeking revenge.

21
00:02:44,160 --> 00:02:46,040
I can't afford to lose you too.

22
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,000
Otherwise,

23
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:52,280
I wouldn't be able to go on living.

24
00:03:00,720 --> 00:03:03,160
I will protect myself.

25
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:05,280
Mom, please don't be sad.

26
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,440
I will grow up properly

27
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:09,400
and always be with you.

28
00:03:25,200 --> 00:03:25,680
Yao.

29
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:26,800
I brought Zizhou

30
00:03:26,840 --> 00:03:27,640
to come see you.

31
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,360
Shanchen,

32
00:03:29,640 --> 00:03:31,560
why brought all these things?

33
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:32,520
Take them.

34
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:34,840
Please, come in.

35
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,400
Shanchen,

36
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,200
what's wrong?

37
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:52,760
After Du Juan passed away,

38
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:55,560
my heart often hurts.

39
00:03:59,200 --> 00:03:59,880
Xiaoquan

40
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,880
is at an age where he's growing.

41
00:04:02,480 --> 00:04:03,840
He needs to eat more nutritious food.

42
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:09,360
Sit down.

43
00:04:18,840 --> 00:04:19,480
Shanchen,

44
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:20,800
you haven't eaten yet, right?

45
00:04:20,880 --> 00:04:22,200
I'll cook a couple more dishes for you.

46
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,480
Don't bother.

47
00:04:23,880 --> 00:04:24,600
I have eaten

48
00:04:24,640 --> 00:04:25,440
with Zizhou.

49
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:26,800
You and Xiaoquan eat.

50
00:04:34,240 --> 00:04:34,840
Yao,

51
00:04:36,080 --> 00:04:36,680
facing something like this

52
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:38,600
I'm sure you're

53
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:40,880
having a tough time.

54
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:44,400
Shanchen,

55
00:04:45,960 --> 00:04:47,440
what's happened has happened.

56
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:49,440
We adults can't collapse.

57
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:51,960
For the sake of the children,

58
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:55,120
we have to strive to live.

59
00:04:59,560 --> 00:05:00,080
Right.

60
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:12,320
Xiaoquan,

61
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:13,280
here's something tasty.

62
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:14,440
Try it.

63
00:05:15,400 --> 00:05:15,560
Here.

64
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:15,800
Go on.

65
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:16,680
Say thank you.

66
00:05:16,760 --> 00:05:17,560
Thank you.

67
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:22,520
Xiaoquan,

68
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,200
this is for you.

69
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,320
Thank you.

70
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,720
Zizhou has been sensible since he was little.

71
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,600
Like a real brother to Xiaoquan.

72
00:05:31,640 --> 00:05:32,280
Yes.

73
00:05:34,680 --> 00:05:35,760
Zong Hai, I,

74
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,280
and Xie Zhengyan

75
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:38,680
grew up together

76
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,640
in Shazhou since childhood.

77
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:43,000
With Huo Jia's help,

78
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:44,880
the three of us

79
00:05:45,680 --> 00:05:46,800
started by carrying timber,

80
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:50,840
and eventually founded a construction company together.

81
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,680
We should have been as close as family.

82
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,920
Who could've thought

83
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:58,680
that Xie Zhengyan went abroad for a project

84
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:02,640
and still hasn't returned.

85
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,800
While Hai

86
00:06:07,680 --> 00:06:08,640
and my wife

87
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,600
would...

88
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,600
would

89
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:16,960
meet such a tragic death at Zhengyan's construction site.

90
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:20,560
Shanchen,

91
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,560
take care.

92
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:24,440
Go on.

93
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:28,960
You coughed up blood

94
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,200
the day they had the accident.

95
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,680
I'm okay for now.

96
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:36,000
You and Xiaoquan eat.

97
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,000
Lu Gao killed someone!

98
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:47,880
Lu Gao killed someone!

99
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:53,880
What a bad lucky day.

100
00:06:54,280 --> 00:06:55,880
Those old ladies who refused to move,

101
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,560
we'll just bury them alive one day.

102
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:58,920
It would be lenient for them.

103
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:00,520
Whoever mess with you,

104
00:07:00,840 --> 00:07:01,720
I'll beat them up.

105
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,040
Yan Shanchen!

106
00:07:04,520 --> 00:07:05,280
Jiang Yao!

107
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,560
Open the door!

108
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:11,440
Yan Shanchen!

109
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,160
Open the door!

110
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:16,440
I know you're in there.

111
00:07:17,400 --> 00:07:18,360
Quite lively.

112
00:07:18,960 --> 00:07:19,640
Open the door!

113
00:07:23,120 --> 00:07:24,200
The grave's still fresh,

114
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,200
yet you've already found a new wife?

115
00:07:37,840 --> 00:07:38,440
Go inside

116
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,120
and eat.

117
00:07:39,440 --> 00:07:40,000
I'll go.

118
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,160
Let's see if they

119
00:07:42,360 --> 00:07:43,600
dare cause trouble here.

120
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:45,360
Be careful.

121
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,320
They're here to pick a fight.

122
00:07:52,080 --> 00:07:53,240
Your wife just passed.

123
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,080
Yet you rush to find Jiang Yao.

124
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,760
You move fast, don't you?

125
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:00,040
What are you doing here?

126
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,520
Don't talk nonsense.

127
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,760
You've already come for Jiang Yao.

128
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,120
Stop pretending to be decent.

129
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:09,960
Quit spreading lies.

130
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:12,000
Shanchen came to see me and Xiaoquan.

131
00:08:12,200 --> 00:08:13,000
None of your business.

132
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:15,760
Well, well.

133
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:19,320
What a happy family!

134
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:21,040
You get lost now!

135
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:22,640
How'd Mr. Xie

136
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:24,760
get a despicable relative like you?

137
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:27,000
My husband died in a mysterious way.

138
00:08:27,280 --> 00:08:29,320
And now you came to slander us?

139
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,320
Looking for death?

140
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:34,480
How dare you speak to Mr. Lu like that?

141
00:08:35,360 --> 00:08:38,280
Du Juan and Zong Hai ignored site safety,

142
00:08:38,560 --> 00:08:41,120
got impaled by steel bars together,

143
00:08:41,920 --> 00:08:43,760
even with pants down.

144
00:08:44,640 --> 00:08:46,440
What doomed lovebirds!

145
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:51,600
Dad!

146
00:08:58,520 --> 00:08:59,320
Why are you

147
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,560
coming here?

148
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:08,680
The affair

149
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:10,240
between your wife Du Juan

150
00:09:10,360 --> 00:09:11,920
and Zong Hai

151
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,400
caused a huge scandal,

152
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,160
bringing Zhengyan Group

153
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:17,240
massive negative impact.

154
00:09:17,840 --> 00:09:18,600
Now the site

155
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,600
has been suspended for three months.

156
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,480
Project losses are incalculable!

157
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:27,320
Your mouth reeks, Lu Gao.

158
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:29,720
What do you want exactly?

159
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,120
What are you up to?

160
00:09:31,160 --> 00:09:32,280
Spill it all out!

161
00:09:34,120 --> 00:09:35,880
Never thought Zong Hai was a coward.

162
00:09:36,480 --> 00:09:37,480
But his wife

163
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:38,720
is quite hot-tempered.

164
00:09:40,760 --> 00:09:42,080
Both your families

165
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:44,160
have to pay the loss.

166
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:46,240
Zong Hai and Yan Shanchen's shares

167
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,680
have been confiscated

168
00:09:48,040 --> 00:09:49,000
by Zhengyan Construction.

169
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,760
Here's the notice.

170
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:59,920
This is the stuff on your and Zong Hai's desks.

171
00:10:00,560 --> 00:10:01,520
From now on,

172
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,800
you're banned from the company.

173
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:06,120
You!

174
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,920
Those shares were divided fair by us three

175
00:10:09,240 --> 00:10:10,680
since we started business

176
00:10:10,880 --> 00:10:11,760
in Stellarport.

177
00:10:12,280 --> 00:10:13,400
You don't have that authority!

178
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:15,840
The law will teach you a lesson.

179
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,320
You darn man,

180
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,440
got some temper.

181
00:10:22,400 --> 00:10:23,600
You're monsters!

182
00:10:23,880 --> 00:10:25,840
You got Zong Hai killed,

183
00:10:26,160 --> 00:10:27,440
and now even came to extort us?

184
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:29,880
Death doesn't erase debts.

185
00:10:30,400 --> 00:10:32,480
The company fired you.

186
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,920
It was Chairman Xie's decision.

187
00:10:35,880 --> 00:10:36,720
Here.

188
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,160
Open your eyes and see

189
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:43,760
who signed this.

190
00:10:44,120 --> 00:10:45,640
It's Xie Two's signature.

191
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:47,160
Where is he?

192
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:48,880
Xie Two?

193
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:52,240
That's the chairman of Zhengyan Construction.

194
00:10:52,800 --> 00:10:54,040
You even called his nickname?

195
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:55,760
But you still got kicked

196
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,600
out of the group by him.

197
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:02,560
This is my house.

198
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:04,960
Take one step closer or lay a hand,

199
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,640
I'll defend myself

200
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:07,600
and chop you up!

201
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:12,800
Mom, I'll protect you.

202
00:11:18,800 --> 00:11:19,360
Lu Gao.

203
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:20,720
We've already called the police.

204
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,200
If you dare lay a finger on Xiaoquan today,

205
00:11:23,400 --> 00:11:26,680
I swear I'll make your loved ones end up in hell.

206
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:27,680
What?

207
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:29,120
Police?

208
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:31,920
You little brat dare threaten me?

209
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,880
Spouting such vicious threats?

210
00:11:34,280 --> 00:11:35,840
I'm feeling generous today,

211
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:38,000
so I'll let you off for now.

212
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:40,960
But if you don't get out of Stellarport soon,

213
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:43,280
none of you will make it out alive.

214
00:11:48,400 --> 00:11:50,880
I'm just here today delivering a message from the Chairman.

215
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,760
Forgot to mention,

216
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:54,880
right now,

217
00:11:55,080 --> 00:11:56,440
this is your house,

218
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,400
but tomorrow,

219
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:58,800
even Yan Shanchen's house

220
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:01,160
will be reclaimed by the company.

221
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:06,080
Take these two reckless kids

222
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:08,840
and get off Zhengyan Construction's land.

223
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:12,000
I'm giving you a heads-up.

224
00:12:14,880 --> 00:12:16,760
Tomorrow, bring men here to smash this place.

225
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:17,920
Let's go.

226
00:12:28,480 --> 00:12:30,800
Xie Two is so heartless.

227
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:33,040
Let's not discuss it now.

228
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,160
Let Zizhou and Xiaoquan

229
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,280
come eat something first.

230
00:12:38,280 --> 00:12:39,480
There's always hope.

231
00:12:39,800 --> 00:12:41,400
At worst, we return to Shazhou.

232
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:44,400
Our old house in Crescent Bay Chinatown is still there.

233
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:47,840
They said to smash the house tomorrow.

234
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:49,400
Zhengnian, steel bars.

235
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:50,880
Dad.

236
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:51,640
Aunt Jiang.

237
00:12:51,880 --> 00:12:53,640
I'll protect Xiaoquan from now on.

238
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:02,680
Zizhou.

239
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,920
You intentionally left a design flaw

240
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:05,880
in the drawing you gave Liluo,

241
00:13:06,600 --> 00:13:08,120
just to catch He Zhengnian's attention?

242
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:10,640
Yes.

243
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,200
That drawing

244
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,440
looks flawless on the surface,

245
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,960
but only those who've built such buildings

246
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:18,760
would spot the hidden flaw.

247
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:21,120
He Zhengnian cuts corners on construction costs,

248
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:22,840
raking in huge profits.

249
00:13:23,160 --> 00:13:24,400
This is the exact method he uses

250
00:13:24,880 --> 00:13:26,840
to cover up deadly construction errors.

251
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:28,120
So,

252
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,760
it will definitely grab his attention.

253
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:33,480
Using a drawing as bait,

254
00:13:33,960 --> 00:13:34,680
could it

255
00:13:35,240 --> 00:13:36,400
alert He Zhengnian

256
00:13:36,520 --> 00:13:37,200
and put you in danger?

257
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:40,040
After the commander tower was crashed by a ship and collapsed,

258
00:13:40,720 --> 00:13:41,920
causing multiple casualties,

259
00:13:42,280 --> 00:13:44,560
Helie's entire leadership was shaken.

260
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:47,160
He Huan and the tycoons backing her

261
00:13:47,560 --> 00:13:49,760
must rush to complete the construction of Bayron Commercial Street

262
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:51,440
and the Sailboat Hotel

263
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,360
to appease the international narrative

264
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,400
and cover up their fraud

265
00:13:55,800 --> 00:13:57,720
of getting a huge amount of insurance.

266
00:13:58,720 --> 00:13:59,640
That drawing

267
00:14:00,200 --> 00:14:02,480
is the key to helping them achieve that goal.

268
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,880
So you mean...

269
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:09,720
Time for us to launch a full counterattack.

270
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:11,400
Now,

271
00:14:11,560 --> 00:14:13,080
we don't just reclaim our home,

272
00:14:13,760 --> 00:14:16,440
but also infiltrate Zhengyan Group with our allies' help,

273
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,280
convincing the people around He Huan

274
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,720
to go against her,

275
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,760
help us reclaim the shares,

276
00:14:22,120 --> 00:14:23,560
and handle the strait incident.

277
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:51,280
Hi

278
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:59,000
Take your time.
